---
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const APP_URL = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APP_URL ?? 'https://app.myground.work';
---
<Layout title="Use cases · Groundwork" description="New hires, partnerships, project kick-offs, leadership transitions. Groundwork builds a shared record for any situation where expectations need to be clear." canonicalPath="/use-cases">
  <style>
    *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;overflow-x:hidden}
    .gw-nav-link{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:#6B6560;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:6px;font-family:inherit;transition:all .15s;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;}
    .gw-nav-link:hover{background:#E8E6E3;color:#1A1916;}
    .gw-btn-ghost{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#0C447C;background:none;border:1px solid #B5D4F4;cursor:pointer;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:6px;font-family:inherit;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .15s;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;}
    .gw-btn-ghost:hover{background:#EEF4FB;}
    .gw-btn-solid{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:#0C447C;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:6px;font-family:inherit;white-space:nowrap;transition:background .15s;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;}
    .gw-btn-solid:hover{background:#1557A0;}
    .gw-case-card{border:1px solid #E2E0DB;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:12px;background:#fff;}
    .gw-case-title{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#1A1916;margin-bottom:6px;}
    .gw-case-body{font-size:13.5px;color:#4A5568;line-height:1.7;margin:0;}
    .gw-section-label{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9B9590;font-weight:700;margin:32px 0 14px;}
    .gw-footer-btn{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.38);background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
    .gw-footer-btn:hover{color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);}
    @media(max-width:620px){
      .gw-nav-links{display:none !important;}
    }
  </style>

  <div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#EDECEA;min-height:100vh;color:#1A1916;">

    <Nav current="/use-cases" />

    <main style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;padding:56px 24px 80px;">
      <p style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0C447C;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:12px;">Use cases</p>
      <h1 style="font-size:32px;font-weight:800;color:#1A1916;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:16px;">Where Groundwork earns its place.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:16px;color:#6B6560;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:8px;">The shape is the same every time. Each person gives their own account, independently. Groundwork shows where they match, where they differ, and what to do about it. Here is what that looks like across the moments it helps most.</p>

      <!-- ITEM 4: these cards ARE the picker's cards. The page had drifted to
           sixteen cards with different labels, different descriptions and its
           own grouping scheme, so a visitor read one product here and met
           another when they started. The picker is the source of truth; labels,
           descriptions and groups are copied from it verbatim.
           ITEM 7b: the anti-surveillance touch below, so someone landing here
           cold from a search does not read a page of situations with no
           reassurance anywhere. -->
      <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#9B9590;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;margin:36px 0 14px;">Starting something</p>
      <div class="gw-case-grid">
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">New hire starting</div><p class="gw-case-body">Get you and a new hire meaning the same thing by "doing well", before anything drifts.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">New project</div><p class="gw-case-body">Line everyone up on goals, roles, and what "done" means before the work starts.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">A new partner, cofounder, or manager</div><p class="gw-case-body">Someone new is sharing the work or taking it over. Each of you says what you expect before those assumptions harden.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">New advisor or board member</div><p class="gw-case-body">Pin down what they will actually contribute, and on what terms, so "available" does not stand in for contributing.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">Onboarding several people at once</div><p class="gw-case-body">Several people starting the same role at once. Each answers on their own, so you see who is on track and who is stuck.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#9B9590;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;margin:36px 0 14px;">Goals, plans and decisions</p>
      <div class="gw-case-grid">
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">Setting shared goals</div><p class="gw-case-body">A team agreeing on what matters most this period, each person's own view, not just the room's consensus, so effort doesn't spread in different directions.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">A big decision</div><p class="gw-case-body">A group making a real choice, each person's honest read before you commit.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">Workplan and budget</div><p class="gw-case-body">Each person builds their own plan and budget, and you see whether it holds up against what is actually available.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">Board and leadership strategy</div><p class="gw-case-body">Each leader gives their own read before the room debates it, so quiet disagreement shows up now and not after the decision.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#9B9590;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;margin:36px 0 14px;">Keeping a regular read</p>
      <div class="gw-case-grid">
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">A regular read on live work</div><p class="gw-case-body">A short, repeatable read from each person on what is moving, what is stuck, and what has changed since last time.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">Many people in the same role</div><p class="gw-case-body">Field officers, branch managers, franchisees. Each answers on their own, so you see the pattern rather than the loudest voice.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#9B9590;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;margin:36px 0 14px;">A decision about someone</p>
      <div class="gw-case-grid">
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">Raise, promotion, or recognition</div><p class="gw-case-body">The person builds the evidence behind the ask and the decision maker reads the same record, so both start from the same picture.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">Contract or renewal</div><p class="gw-case-body">Both sides give an honest account of how the term actually went and what a fair next one looks like.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#9B9590;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;margin:36px 0 14px;">When something needs addressing</p>
      <div class="gw-case-grid">
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">Someone's work is off track</div><p class="gw-case-body">Deadlines or expectations are slipping. Both of you give your honest account of what's happening, so the conversation starts from the same facts, not one side's version.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">A project is off track</div><p class="gw-case-body">What was agreed and what exists no longer match. Get each person's honest read before the group talks.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">You and someone see it differently</div><p class="gw-case-body">From working off different priorities to a real rift between partners. Each of you gives your honest read first, so you start from the same picture instead of resentment, and close the gap before it grows.</p></div>
        <div class="gw-case-card"><div class="gw-case-title">A shock just hit</div><p class="gw-case-body">Something jarring just happened. Get everyone's honest read of where things stand before anyone decides anything.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div style="background:#F5F3EF;border:1px solid #E2E0DB;border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px;margin-top:36px;">
        <p style="font-size:14px;color:#4A5568;line-height:1.75;margin:0;">Whichever one you start, the shape is the same. Everyone gives their own account, privately. Nobody is scored, ranked or watched, and no one sees anyone else's raw answers.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:40px;">
        <a class="gw-btn-solid" href={`${APP_URL}/start`} style="padding:13px 28px;font-size:14px;">Start a Ground</a>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer style="background:#0A1628;padding:32px 24px;text-align:center;">
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:16px;">
        <svg width="18" height="14" viewBox="0 0 22 17" fill="none">
          <rect x="5"  y="0"  width="12" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="white" opacity="0.45"/>
          <rect x="2"  y="6"  width="18" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="white" opacity="0.72"/>
          <rect x="0"  y="12" width="22" height="3" rx="1.5" fill="white"/>
        </svg>
        <span style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);">Groundwork</span>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px;">
        <a class="gw-footer-btn" href="/">Home</a>
        <a class="gw-footer-btn" href="/how-it-works">How it works</a>
        <a class="gw-footer-btn" href="/use-cases">Use cases</a>
        <a class="gw-footer-btn" href="/pricing">Pricing</a>
        <a class="gw-footer-btn" href="/about">About</a>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.2);margin:0;">&#169; 2026 Groundwork</p>
    </footer>

  </div>
</Layout>
